  "solution": "Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>Δ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Độ dài đoạn thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là nhỏ nhất khi và chỉ khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nhỏ nhất.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Dấu ““ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mo>=</mo></semantics></math>”” xẩy ra khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
